Next — Database setup
Before we write code — you tell me:
What is PostgreSQL and why do we use it instead of just saving data in a Python list?
Think. Answer. 🧱You said: i dont rememberi dont rememberJun 5Claude responded: No problem.No problem. Simple answer:

Python list:
pythonusers = ["John", "Jane"]  # gone when server restarts
PostgreSQL:

Data saved permanently
Even if server restarts → data still there
Multiple users can read/write at same time


