System Design First
Step 1 — Entities
An entity = a "thing" in your app that needs to be stored.
You tell me — what are the main "things" in CollabSpace?
Hint: think about what users can create or interact with.
Example: User is one entity. What else? 🧱You said: UserUserWorkspaceDocumentInviteCode
These are the main entities because users create workspaces, workspaces contain documents, and invite codes allow users to join workspaces.Jun 6Claude responded: Excellent thinking.Excellent thinking. 💪
