Also — always lowercase URLs. workspace not Workspace.

Now let's map all endpoints for CollabSpace:
Auth:
POST /auth/register
POST /auth/login

Workspaces:
GET    /workspaces
GET    /workspaces/{id}
POST   /workspaces
PUT    /workspaces/{id}
DELETE /workspaces/{id}

Tasks:
GET    /workspaces/{id}/tasks
POST   /workspaces/{id}/tasks
PUT    /tasks/{id}
DELETE /tasks/{id}

Documents:
GET    /workspaces/{id}/documents
POST   /workspaces/{id}/documents
PUT    /documents/{id}
DELETE /documents/{id}
Notice: Tasks and Documents are under /workspaces/{id}/ — because they belong to a workspace.
