✅ WorkspaceMember
✅ Task
✅ Document
✅ InviteCode
✅ Notification

Relationships:
✅ User → many Workspaces
✅ Workspace → many Members (junction table)
✅ Workspace → many Tasks
✅ Workspace → many Documents

Endpoints:
✅ Auth
✅ Workspaces
✅ Tasks
✅ Documents

