Big picture of what we're building:
React Login form → 
axios sends POST /auth/login → 
FastAPI returns token → 
React stores token → 
uses token for future requests

First — create an axios instance.
File: frontend/src/api/axios.js
Why this file?

Instead of typing http://127.0.0.1:8000 everywhere → we configure it once here.
javascriptimport axios from 'axios'

const api = axios.create({
  baseURL: 'http://127.0.0.1:8000',
})

export default api
