You tell me — what does [...workspaces, response.data] do? 🧱You said: workspace make a space for group to do work on and response  data gives respomse on dataworkspace make a space for group to do work on and response  data gives respomse on dataJun 13Claude responded: Close.Close. More precise:

...workspaces = copy all existing workspaces. response.data = add the new one at the end. Result = new array with all old + new workspace.

